    <briefdescription>
<para>Fail-safe handler for adapter merge faults. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Policy:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Any fault during a merge that has a valid pre-merge snapshot triggers ROLLBACK to the snapshot, regardless of how many layers were merged.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>If the snapshot is empty (no adapter_id), strategy is ABORT_MERGE.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Partial merges (layers_merged_before_fault &gt; 0) always emit a PARTIAL_MERGE diagnostic incident before the rollback decision. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
